WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.299 --> 00:00:04.940
Dr. Bright is to be consistently reminded
that, if what he is doing involves doing something

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:05.940
wrong?

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:07.740
It is not the right thing to do.

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:09.940
Sure, the Foundation could always use more
funding.

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:14.370
However, that does not mean it is acceptable
for Dr. Bright to organize a massive heist

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:19.050
at a luxury casino, recruiting a variety of
retired criminals to carry out a detailed

00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:21.699
multi-step plan of espionage, deception, and
robbery.

00:00:21.699 --> 00:00:26.029
It might have worked out in the Ocean’s
film series, but it is not the sort of behavior

00:00:26.029 --> 00:00:28.580
the Foundation condones in the real world.

00:00:28.580 --> 00:00:30.519
We live in a society, dammit!

00:00:30.519 --> 00:00:32.430
There are rules we have to follow!

00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:37.309
Sure, we do a great deal of possibly unethical
human testing, resulting in thousands of D-Class

00:00:37.309 --> 00:00:40.329
deaths every year, but we have to draw the
line somewhere.

